  "question": "Q22: what do the four meter values (GetMeterValue 0-3) mean with Resistance or Irms metering on? Each is turned on and off through the API, one at a time and both together, in V-Clamp, and one at a time in I-Clamp (Irms is V-Clamp only, so there its Set may be refused), with all four meters read 0, 0.5, 1, 2 and 4 s after each Set, and a screenshot of Commander's meters after each.",
